<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to abolish the dependent domicile of
married women and otherwise to reform the law relating to
domicile.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_27820cc7-b733-4f82-9932-b6d071f18429"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_3f7f20d7-0977-4a66-8cfe-ac85cbf985e5"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1979-118" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Domicile Act
1979</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9dac9b7b-2923-4a37-a5ec-60675a6fc13d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_15daaf06-799d-4c05-b544-99377d6bb995"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6227042c-4741-42a8-8cee-50b4a4d714f4"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 1 and this section shall commence on the
date of assent to this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3a2265ac-ddf1-4c55-99c0-563f9cfdfce9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Except as provided in subsection (1), this Act
shall commence on such day as may be appointed by the Governor in respect
thereof and as may be notified by proclamation published in the
Gazette.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63664214-214e-4a6b-822b-ed9abfa65f79"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_80a89710-55bb-46d7-b90c-01d7d9859fa1"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, except in so far as the context or
subject-matter otherwise indicates or requires:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_e79174d7-6b5f-42c6-b55e-47f1b2999271"
id="def.CommonwealthofAustralia"><b><i>Commonwealth of
Australia</i></b></defterm> means the territory comprising the States and the
Australian Capital Territory, the Jervis Bay Territory and the Northern
Territory of Australia.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_60383e94-c498-45d9-bb93-475435dd4ceb"
id="def.country"><b><i>country</i></b></defterm> includes any state, province
or other territory:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4e4d5581-f95d-43c6-91ef-0550da8e77da" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">that is one of two or more territories that
together form a country, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_61367aa4-ab35-4743-8956-47741c0a775c" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">domicile in which can be material for any purpose
of the laws of New South Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_42f97eb1-87ff-4768-95c0-22c94892e0e7"
id="def.union"><b><i>union</i></b></defterm> means any country that is a union
or federation or other aggregation of two or more countries and includes the
Commonwealth of Australia.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d7baf2f1-84d6-41a8-83ee-7c3bed0361dd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_5daa2894-ac22-4f08-9baa-e2b3e58870c1"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Operation of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_13f8684a-95a6-4151-8249-c1d6be0372ae"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The domicile of a person at a time before the
commencement of this section shall be determined as if this Act had not been
enacted.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_089140b3-8070-4f9f-9f2d-b0b4ec3b8ccd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The domicile of a person at a time after the
commencement of this section shall be determined as if this Act had always
been in force.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f8ce477e-fcf5-43da-bcf4-6e00bed820f0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act affects the jurisdiction of
any court in any proceedings commenced before the commencement of this
section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6707c5c8-8eba-4797-a96d-08b04f18f947"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act has effect to the exclusion of the
application of the laws of any other country relating to any matter dealt with
by this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12a6747d-62e1-4999-ac1d-9ba5eef46d8d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_cb321486-65c3-4052-878c-60a7f337548b"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Abolition of rule of dependent domicile of married
woman</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The rule of law whereby a married woman has at
all times the domicile of her husband is abolished.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_efb5040d-0aff-4f0e-87b7-519c3de25ece"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_bf4de00d-97e4-47dc-a2c1-b65dd6f47dbd"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Abolition of rule of revival of domicile of
origin</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The rule of law whereby the domicile of origin
revives upon the abandonment of a domicile of choice without the acquisition
of a new domicile of choice is abolished and the domicile a person has at any
time continues until the person acquires a different
domicile.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_431b9def-3250-4f3c-9c00-1144860ac2ce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_b37f8f19-47f4-4074-be59-0ffa0315d24f"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Capacity to have independent domicile</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_97354a4a-9949-4cc2-9303-3db44ccc8908"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person is capable of having an independent
domicile if:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_66af840a-2513-4176-ad7c-513041267b75" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person has attained the age of 18 years,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_218f3bc7-d5cc-4125-a8a9-fec4367cb9d5" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the person is, or has at any time been,
married,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">and not otherwise.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1e9bc3ab-6111-4c92-aa4e-be4817aad6e1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) does not apply to a person who,
under the rules of law relating to domicile, is incapable of acquiring a
domicile by reason of mental incapacity.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_40df66af-2cb1-435d-9156-e87263144b66"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_6c1227e8-8884-43ed-81a4-b7f460f7d96a"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Domicile of certain children</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8b03c447-4cdb-4af2-a341-88b82745b1be"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_51367d2a-9cfe-41b4-bb52-9fd25bc92eda" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_ee8cbe4b-c8ea-4b31-bc46-3052f2ba3653"
id="sec.8-ssec.1-def.child"><b><i>child</i></b></defterm> means a person under
the age of 18 years who is not, and has not at any time been, married,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4682f6ee-c750-4b0a-88e0-adb24acddfdb" id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">references to the parents of a child include
references to parents who are not married to each
other.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cf0b6101-af43-4f79-9caa-9663299fd16a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where, at any time, a child has his or her
principal home with one of the child&#8217;s parents but the parents are
living separately and apart or the child does not have another living parent,
the domicile of the child at that time is the domicile that that parent has at
that time and thereafter the child has the domicile that that parent has from
time to time or, if that parent has died, the domicile that that parent had at
the time of death.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_71ce522f-8fd4-441c-adcd-71ee52106827"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where a child is adopted, the child&#8217;s
domicile:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c66faf09-c73d-4618-8a4e-9754b303a414" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if, upon the child&#8217;s adoption, the child
has two parents&#8212;is, at the time of the adoption and thereafter, the
domicile the child would have if the child were a child born in wedlock to
those parents, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_17d75127-0977-4468-b92e-43eeee68be63" id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if, upon the child&#8217;s adoption, the child
has one parent only&#8212;is, at the time of the adoption, the domicile of
that parent and thereafter is the domicile that that parent has from time to
time or, if that parent has died, the domicile that that parent had at the
time of death.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7988dd90-1b9a-4fb8-9c46-e3ebcb575853"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A child ceases to have, by virtue of subsection
(2), the domicile or last domicile of one of the parents if:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_093a31e2-145d-483f-8675-ee9d6dc3cd69" id="sec.8-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the child commences to have his or her principal
home with the other parent, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c9484627-4f00-496a-ac83-58dab57310b0" id="sec.8-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the parents resume or commence living
together.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7783f5da-94d9-4fd4-9bd9-357dcab506da"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where a child has a domicile by virtue of
subsection (2) or (3) immediately before the child ceases to be a child, the
child retains that domicile until the child acquires a domicile of
choice.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_06a8ace0-1f29-4fb8-9ee7-92a0b4535530"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where the adoption of a child is rescinded, the
domicile of the child shall thereafter be determined in accordance with any
provisions with respect to that domicile that are included in the order
rescinding the adoption and, so far as no such provision is applicable, as if
the adoption had not taken place.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0d357ff6-595b-4772-bcd9-a6e9061f0e40"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_a7683e30-1534-49c0-aaf2-f46af5134e18"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Intention for domicile of choice</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The intention that a person must have in order to
acquire a domicile of choice in a country is the intention to make his or her
home indefinitely in that country.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_79476d78-f9af-4760-a90b-0c254a7ed642"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_56a1426f-b682-4c8e-a23e-15a4088b1bea"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Domicile in a union</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person who is, in accordance with the rules of
the common law as modified by this Act, domiciled in a union but is not, apart
from this section, domiciled in any particular one of the countries that
together form the union is domiciled in that one of those countries with which
the person has for the time being the closest
connexion.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
