<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_868b2675-79cf-4deb-8797-5d0e9f18755a"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Evidence of acquisition of domicile of
choice</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The acquisition of a domicile of choice in place
of a domicile of origin may be established by evidence that would be
sufficient to establish the domicile of choice if the previous domicile had
also been a domicile of choice.</txt></block></level>
</content>


